{% raw %}<section class="band band-photo"><img src="/images/2018/06/Cabinetry_Header-hero.webp" alt="All Wood Cabinets" width="1200" height="900" fetchpriority="high" class="band-img"></section><section class="band"><div class="wrap"><div class="el-row" style="--cols:50fr 50fr"><div class="el-col"><h1>See All Your Choices in Kitchen Cabinets</h1><h2>From SInger Kitchens Serving New Orleans &amp; the Northshore</h2><div class="el-text"><p><strong>See All Your Choices in Kitchen Cabinets</strong> From Singer Kitchens — Serving New Orleans &amp; the Northshore Since 1928</p><p>Is your kitchen ready for an upgrade? At Singer Kitchens, we carry cabinet lines at every level, so whatever your project, your timeline or your budget, we’ll help you find the right fit.</p><p>Every cabinet we sell meets our standards for craftsmanship, materials and durability. Every selection we make starts with a conversation about how you actually live in your kitchen.</p><p>Since 1928, we’ve been helping Greater New Orleans homeowners make confident cabinet decisions. That hasn’t changed.</p></div></div><div class="el-col"><figure class="el-img"><img src="/images/2020/02/Singer-Kitchens-Cabinets-NewOrleans-1.webp" alt="Wood cabinets with a stainless island hood and white quartz counters" width="1200" height="801" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure></div></div></div></section><section class="band"><div class="wrap"><h2>The guidance you won't find at a box store</h2><div class="el-text"><p>You might find some of the same brand names elsewhere. What you won't find is a designer who knows how to put it all together for your specific kitchen, your layout, and the way your family actually uses the space.</p><p>At Singer, our design consultants help you sort through the choices including door styles, finishes, interior configurations and colors, then help you land on what's right for you.</p></div><div class="el-block"><div class="el-row" style="--cols:50fr 50fr"><div class="el-col"><div class="el-text"><p><strong>A few things worth knowing:</strong></p></div><ul class="icon-list"><li>All of our cabinet lines offer solid wood construction.</li><li>Factory finishes and factory warranties are a meaningful difference from shop built cabinetry.</li><li>Custom color matching is available. We've matched cabinets to paint colors, tile, even a customer's dog</li><li>Modifications to sizing and configuration are available across most of our lines</li></ul></div><div class="el-col"><figure class="el-img"><img src="/images/2021/05/singer-cabinets-mandeville.webp" alt="White shaker cabinets with a farmhouse sink and brick-look backsplash" width="1200" height="801" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure></div></div></div></div></section><section class="band"><div class="wrap"><h2>We have a cabinet solution for every project</h2><div class="el-text">We don't think you should have to go somewhere else to find what you need. Whether you're doing a quick refresh or a full kitchen renovation, we'll show you the options that make sense for your scope and your budget and help you decide.</div><div class="el-text"><p><strong>Need it fast?</strong> For landlords, rental properties, laundry rooms, pantries, vanities, or anyone who wants a clean, quality result without a lot of back-and-forth, we carry lines that are quick ship, available in a range of styles and finishes and priced to fit your budget.</p></div><div class="el-text"><p><strong>Want more flexibility?</strong> For full kitchen renovations where you want more control over sizing, finish, color and configuration, we have cabinet lines that offer those options. More door styles, more colors, modification options and the design support to put it all together the right way.</p></div></div></section><section class="band"><div class="wrap"><div class="el-text"><p><em><strong>The best way to choose cabinets is to see them in person. Touch the finishes. See how colors look in real light. Work with a designer who can help you narrow it down.</strong></em></p></div></div></section><section class="band"><div class="wrap"><div class="el-row" style="--cols:50fr 50fr"><div class="el-col"><h2>New Orleans</h2><div class="map"><iframe src="https://maps.google.com/maps?q=231%20N.%20Carrollton%20Ave%2C%20New%20Orleans&amp;t=m&amp;z=15&amp;output=embed&amp;iwloc=near" title="Map: 231 N. Carrollton Ave, New Orleans" loading="lazy"></iframe></div><div class="el-text"><p><a href="https://maps.google.com/maps?ll=29.976071,-90.099626&amp;z=15&amp;t=m&amp;hl=en-US&amp;gl=US&amp;mapclient=embed&amp;q=231%20N%20Carrollton%20Ave%20New%20Orleans%2C%20LA%2070119%20USA" target="_blank" rel="noopener">231 N. Carrollton Ave.<br>(at Bienville, across from Brocato's)<br>New Orleans, LA 70119</a><br><a href="tel:+15044860067">(504) 486-0067</a><br>Hours: Mon-Fri 10am-5pm, Sat 10am-3pm by Appointment</p></div></div><div class="el-col"><h2>Mandeville</h2><div class="map"><iframe src="https://maps.google.com/maps?q=316%20Girod%20St%20Mandeville%2C%20LA%2070448&amp;t=m&amp;z=15&amp;output=embed&amp;iwloc=near" title="Map: 316 Girod St Mandeville, LA 70448" loading="lazy"></iframe></div><div class="el-text"><p><a href="https://maps.google.com/maps?ll=30.356077,-90.066775&amp;z=15&amp;t=m&amp;hl=en-US&amp;gl=US&amp;mapclient=embed&amp;q=316%20Girod%20St%20Mandeville%2C%20LA%2070448%20USA" target="_blank" rel="noopener">316 Girod St.<br>(Old Mandeville)<br>Mandeville, LA 70448</a><br><a href="tel:+19857782978">(985) 778-2978</a><br>Hours: Mon-Fri 10am-5pm, Sat 10am-3pm by Appointment</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="band"><div class="wrap"><div class="el-row" style="--cols:50fr 50fr"><div class="el-col"><figure class="el-img"><img src="/images/2020/02/Kitchen-cabinets-neworleans.webp" alt="Kitchen with a grey island, granite countertops and copper pendant lights" width="800" height="534" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure></div><div class="el-col"><h2>Renovating your whole kitchen or just need cabinets? Both work for us.</h2><div class="el-text"><p>Some of our customers are doing a full kitchen renovation with design, cabinets, countertops and installation. We help handle everything from the first design conversation to the last cabinet going in. One team, one point of contact.</p><p>If you’re already working with a contractor, we'll help you design and select the right cabinets for your project.</p><p>Either way, you start in the same place, a conversation with one of our designers.</p></div><p class="btn-row"><a class="btn" href="/request-consultation/">Schedule a Design Conversation</a></p></div></div></div></section><section class="band"><div class="wrap"><div class="el-row" style="--cols:50fr 50fr"><div class="el-col"><h2>What to expect from Singer cabinets</h2><ul class="icon-list"><li>Solid wood construction</li><li>Soft-close doors and drawers</li><li>A selection of organizational options including pull-out shelves, drawer inserts, appliance garages, and more</li><li>Factory finishes built to last</li><li>Custom color options</li></ul><div class="el-text"><p><strong>Cabinet lines we carry:</strong> Fabuwood · Diamond · Diamond Vibe · Aristokraft · Decora · Kitchen Craft · NorthPoint · Mantra</p></div></div><div class="el-col"><figure class="el-img"><img src="/images/2025/03/2mls.webp" alt="Narrow white galley kitchen with a stainless hood" width="1001" height="1500" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure></div></div></div></section><section class="band"><div class="wrap"><figure class="el-img"><a href="/kitchen-design-checklist/"><img src="/images/2020/04/remodeling-checklist-cta-banner.webp" alt="Kitchen Remodeling Checklist, download now" width="800" height="200" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a></figure></div></section><section class="band"><div class="wrap"><div class="el-block"><figure class="el-img"><img src="/images/2018/07/madeinusa.webp" alt="Made in USA flag" width="200" height="200" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure></div></div></section><section class="band"><div class="wrap"><div class="el-row" style="--cols:33fr 66fr"><div class="el-col"><figure class="el-img"><img src="/images/2023/07/Fabuwood-Logo.webp" alt="Fabuwood cabinetry logo" width="1200" height="291" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure></div><div class="el-col"><div class="el-text"><p>Fabuwood specializes in creating kitchens that evoke a feeling of home. Offering a seamless balance of functionality, endurance and poise, Fabuwood cabinets are built to withstand the test of time.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="band"><div class="wrap"><div class="el-row" style="--cols:33fr 66fr"><div class="el-col"><figure class="el-img"><a href="/diamond-cabinets/"><img src="/images/2023/09/Diamond_Log.webp" alt="Diamond cabinetry logo" width="200" height="43" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a></figure></div><div class="el-col"><div class="el-text"><p>The Diamond approach is simple: Don't just think different. Think smarter. Think inside the box. It's all about finding creative ways to get more out of every kitchen or bathroom cabinet. More space. More accessibility.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="band"><div class="wrap"><div class="el-row" style="--cols:33fr 66fr"><div class="el-col"><figure class="el-img"><a href="/diamond-cabinets/"><img src="/images/2018/04/diamond-vibe-logo.webp" alt="Cabinetry by Diamond Vibe logo" width="200" height="67" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a></figure></div><div class="el-col"><div class="el-text"><p>Diamond Vibe cabinetry is designed to fit into your unique remodeling plans. Choose from the freshest finishes and door styles, along with organizational solutions that put everyday essentials within easy reach.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="band"><div class="wrap"><div class="el-row" style="--cols:33fr 66fr"><div class="el-col"><figure class="el-img"><img src="/images/2018/04/aristokraft_2-color.webp" alt="Aristokraft Cabinetry logo" width="250" height="57" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure></div><div class="el-col"><div class="el-text"><p>Aristokraft has been creating quality cabinets with an eye on affordability since 1954. Aristokraft products feature state-of-the-art finishes, easy-clean interiors and dependable hardware - all with great style in mind. </p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="band"><div class="wrap"><div class="el-row" style="--cols:33fr 66fr"><div class="el-col"><figure class="el-img"><img src="/images/2018/04/decora_cb_black.webp" alt="Cabinetry by Decorá logo" width="218" height="84" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure></div><div class="el-col"><div class="el-text"><p>Take personalization to the limit with the semi-custom choices available in the Decora cabinet line. Decora's custom paint program offers the option of over 2000 Sherwin Williams paint colors in addition to a large spectrum of wood tones, glazes and brushed finishes.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="band"><div class="wrap"><div class="el-row" style="--cols:33fr 66fr"><div class="el-col"><figure class="el-img"><img src="/images/2018/04/KC_NewLogo.webp" alt="KitchenCraft Cabinetry logo" width="654" height="129" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure></div><div class="el-col"><div class="el-text"><p>Kitchen Craft focuses on frameless construction because it provides seamless visual beauty while maximizing interior storage space. This means more space and full access to what you need when you need it.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="band"><div class="wrap"><div class="el-row" style="--cols:33fr 66fr"><div class="el-col"><figure class="el-img"><img src="/images/2023/01/Man_RGB_Black.webp" alt="Mantra cabinetry logo" width="1200" height="172" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure></div><div class="el-col"><div class="el-text"><p>Mantra offers quality, all-wood cabinets with all the upgrades built-in along with short lead times to meet the tightest of deadlines.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="band"><div class="wrap"><div class="el-row" style="--cols:33fr 66fr"><div class="el-col"><figure class="el-img"><img src="/images/2026/06/Northpoint.webp" alt="North Point Cabinetry logo" width="240" height="150" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure></div><div class="el-col"><div class="el-text"><p>NorthPoint Cabinetry offers high-quality cabinet styles and configurations to help create a beautiful, functional kitchen or bath.</p></div></div></div></div></section>{% endraw %}{% include "partials/process-strip.njk" %}{% raw %}<section class="band"><div class="wrap"><h2>Let's Talk About YOUR Kitchen.</h2><div class="el-text"><p>Whether you're ready to move forward or just starting to figure out what's possible, a conversation with one of our designers is the best way to get started. No pressure, no obligation, just clarity.</p><p>Schedule a Design Conversation at singerkitchens.com Or call us at <strong>(504) 539-4605</strong></p><p>Showroom locations in <strong>New Orleans &amp; Mandeville</strong> Mon–Fri: 10AM–5PM · Saturday: 10AM–2PM (by appointment)</p></div><div class="el-block"><div class="el-row" style="--cols:50fr 50fr"><div class="el-col"><p class="btn-row"><a class="btn" href="/request-consultation/">Let&#x27;s Talk Kitchens</a></p></div><div class="el-col"><p class="btn-row"><a class="btn" href="tel:+15045394605">(504) 539-4605  |  singerkitchens.com</a></p></div></div></div></div></section>{% endraw %}
